elps Bucky  and starts to walk away Tony yells at  him saying that the shield doesn't  belong to him that he doesn't deserve it  and his father made that shield and  which then Captain America drops his  shield and leaves here's where the comic  gets really interesting because it shows  things that  happened that we did not see in civil  war that lead up to Avengers infinity  war Captain America and Bucky limp  outside where they meet to chala  T'Challa then greets Captain America and  Bucky saying sorry to Bucky because he  believed him to be the man that killed  his father when in fact it was Baron  Zemo he then offers help to Bucky saying  that he can help erase his mental  programming that turns him into a Hydra  assassin he states that as soon as he  delivers emo to the United Nations he  will return to help Bucky in which  Captain America and Bucky replied that  they have a few loose ends to take care  of themselves and that they'll be in  touch  turns out captain and Bucky's unfinished  business is breaking into the raft  high-security prison to break out the  rest of Captain America's team here  Captain America breaks out Sam Wilson  aka Falcon Scott Lang aka ant-man Clint  Barton aka Hawkeye and Wanda Maximoff  aka The Scarlet Witch at this little  reunion Clint Barton announces that he  is officially retired it VIN shows a  clip with him being with his family  again saying you've got to enjoy the  time you got with the ones you love  while you have it perhaps maybe a little  bit of foreshadowing here of some tragic  event that might take place at infinity  war yeah it did shows ant-man going back  and being with his daughter but the most  interesting is that Wanda meets up with  vision but he's in human form we've seen  him in human form in the trailer as well  and I'm really curious to see what the  storyline is here we think cut to a  scene with Captain America and Bucky  with King T'Challa in Wakanda in Wakanda  King to chala states that an order for  Bucky to be rid of his mental  programming he'll have to return to cryo  sleep stasis  Bucky agrees saying that it's really the  only option he has and a few months  later she remakes a breakthrough here's  where it gets really interesting  cheeri states that she's developed an  algorithm that will be able to flush out  the influence of the trigger words while  retaining the court context and content  of those original memories that Bucky  has essentially rebooting him but that's  not the interesting part the interesting  part is that Shuri states that the  algorithm should provide even greater  advancement and will conda's own  artificial intelligent applications in  the near future she also states that  it's much simpler than the silly  shortcut Tony Stark took and creating  Ultron stating that of course it's  because she's smarter than him  this implies that she will have advanced  technology ready for when vision arrives  in Wakanda an infinity war this will  most likely mean that she will be able  to remove the mind stone from visions  for head without killing him I'm not  gonna speculate too much because again  just one more day to wait this next  scene shows a group of terrorists with a  Chitauri fueled weapon for those of you  who aren't familiar with the Chitauri  they're the alien army that invaded New  York and the first Avengers movie under  the command of Loki so basically it's an  alien bomb but surprise Captain America  the Falcon and Black Widow are among the  organization in disguise of course they  defeat them with ease and Captain  America states that the need to strip  the weapons of the Chitauri components  so no one else tries to modify them  Black Widow then asked Steve if he's  sure that he doesn't want to call Tony  Stark on this and what she replies I'm  sure he's got enough on his plate the  group from here then proceeds on to  Lebanon this is actually really cool to  see because this is actually the Secret  Avengers storyline from the comi